    "chunk_text": "01. Lot No. 03 Name of the Land: Koggala Kele; Description of the land: Home Garden, 06 Permanent buildings, 03 water tanks, one water tower, water acrator and a mixed crop cultivation; Claimants: State; Original Claimant: Ambalantota Pradeshiya Sabha; Statutory provisions and reasons for survey: Required for the National Water Supply Board; Extent: 0.4396 Hectare. 02. Lot No. 04 Name of the Land: Koggala Kele; Description of the land: Home Garden, a part of a permanent building and a part of the water tower; Claimants: State; Original Claimant: Ambalantota Pradeshiya Sabha; Statutory provisions and reasons for survey: Has been transferred to the Dept. of Irrigation. Regquired for the National Water Supply Board; Extent: 0.0085 Hectare. All persons who claim ownership, interested or any other connection to the aforesaid land hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me on 22nd September, 2025 at 10.30 a.m. at the Divisional Secretariat, Ambalantota.\n\n(Published by Authority) PART III \u2014 LANDS Land Acquisition Notices\n\n1A - G 45153 - 09 (08/2025)\n\n2 A III \u0dd9\u0d9a\u0ddc\u0da7\u0dc3 - \u0dc1\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0db4\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dd3 \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u0dba\u0dca \u0d85\u0dad\u0dd2 \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0da7\u0dca \u0db4\u0dad\u0dba - 2025.08.16 P\u0d7a\u0d8b\u0d8d III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 16.08.2025\n\nFurther, you are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicates) before 08th September, 2025, the nature of their interests in the land/lands, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the\n\nsaid land/servitude, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount. C\u0d81\u0d82\u0d87\u0d8d\u0d81\u0d7a P. W. W\u0d7a\u0d87\u0d87\u0d82\u0d7a\u0d8b\u0d7a\u0d7c\u0d81\u0d7c\u0d81\u0d82, Divisional Secretary, Ambalantota. Divisional Secretariat, Ambalantota, On 13th August, 2025. EOG 08 - 0184\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
