of Title Settlement.\n\nP.C.D. SIGERA, Commissioner General of Land Title Settlement.\n\nLand Title Settlement Department, No.1200/6, \u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d, Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla 05th August, 2025 EOG 08-0209/2\n\nNOTICE CALLING FOR CLAIMS TO LAND PARCELS"
