    "chunk_text": "i. Implement signage and symbols in accordance with international standards in Sigiriya and other tourist destinations, and obtain international certification as standardized tourist sites.\n\n7. Tourism Promotion, Marketing and Branding\n\nii. Engage in collaboration with Sri Lankan diplomatic missions abroad and embassies in overseas to promote tourism.\n\niii. Enhance tourism products and supply chains.\n\niv. Tourism brand promotion to attract new markets and tourists.\n\nv. Strengthen the capacity of tourism organizations to compete effectively across all market segments.\n\nvi. Establish strong relations with international tourism organizations.\n\nAnd, I appoint Honourable Minister of Foreign Affairs, Foreign Employment and Tourism as the Chairman and the Honourable Deputy Minister of Tourism, as the Vice Chairman Secretary of the aforesaid Presidential Task Force.\n\nAND, I appoint the Secretary to the Ministry of Foreign Affairs, Foreign Employment and Tourism as the Secretary of the aforesaid Presidential Task Force.\n\nAND, I do hereby authorize you, members of the Presidential Task Force, to make inquiries and issue instructions as are required for the purpose of executing the tasks so entrusted, and also to obtain the assistance of the public officers from whom such assistance is intended by the Presidential Task Force, subject to the provisions stipulated in the Constitution of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka and other written laws.\n\nAND, I do hereby require and direct the said Task Force to report to me all instances where any Government employee or an officer in any ministry, government department, state corporation or any such institution who delay the performance of duties and fulfilment of responsibilities or fail to perform such duties and responsibilities to be entrusted by the said Task Force."
